# What may be uploaded to Cloud Build and baked into the public API image.
#
# Strict on purpose. A `.gcloudignore` REPLACES `.gitignore` for upload decisions, so the
# third-party exclusions below are restated here rather than inherited: the organizer data
# pack, the manufacturer artifacts and the runtime cassettes carry no redistribution grant
# and must not travel into a public container.

.git/
.gitignore
.claude/

# Local environments and caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
node_modules/
.next/

# Not part of the API image
frontend/
docs/
research/
tests/
scripts/
Assets/
*.md

# Third-party material with no redistribution grant. Never upload, never bake in.
data/unilog_source/
data/artifacts/
data/replay/

# Committed but unused by the API's five routes; excluded to keep the public image minimal.
data/etim/
data/eval/
data/demo_classes/
data/mappings/
